{"model": "elevenlabs-pvc", "attribute": "architecture", "value": "fine-tunes model weights on the supplied samples", "source_url": "https://elevenlabs.io/docs/eleven-api/concepts/voice-cloning.md", "tier": "vendor", "read_directly": true, "evidence": "Professional Voice Cloning takes a different approach: it fine-tunes the model on your audio samples. Rather than using the audio as a conditioning signal at generation time, PVC actually modifies model parameters to better represent the target voice.", "from": "elevenlabs-vendor (elevenlabs.io/docs, Markdown twins of the Fern docs)"}
